1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,450
(Sheldon:)which indoctrinates them
with all the social graces

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:07,290
(Sheldon:)and dance skills needed to
function in 18th century Vienna.

3
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:11,390
(Penny:)Oh, we are so
taking you dancing.

4
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:13,760
(Sheldon:)No, you most certainly are not.

5
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:16,430
(Bernadette:)Well, what does your cotillion
training say is expected

6
00:00:16,430 --> 00:00:18,630
(Bernadette:)of a gentleman when three ladies
ask him

7
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:20,670
(Bernadette:)to escort them
to a dance soiree?

8
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:26,010
(Sheldon:)I saved a nun's life.

9
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:28,240
(Sheldon:)Why am I being punished?

10
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,150
Take us someplace we can waltz.

11
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:38,390
(Taxi driver:)Where you can what?

12
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:41,120
(Sheldon:)Waltz. It's a social dance
from Austria

13
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:44,160
(Sheldon:)choreographed
to a three-four time signature.

14
00:00:57,540 --> 00:01:03,020
(Sheldon:)Oh, waltz.

